The TRANS_PROBFLAG variable was constructed to alert users to the existence of 
cases whose data may be incomplete or flawed in a way that would make the case 
less likely to provide useful information.  The flag is a composite of five 
separate tests flagging different types of problems; a description of these 
tests can be found in Appendix 11 of the Codebook Supplement.  A positive result
for any one (or more) of those tests resulted in the case being coded 1 in this 
variable.  The variable does not indicate how many flaws are present in a given 
